{"case_id":"LV-E2E-FY2026Q1-MARGIN-OI-001","question":"联想集团 FY2026Q1 毛利率同比下降约 1.8 个百分点，经营利润却同比增长近六成。请指出这一背离主要发生在哪一利润层，量化经营费用（=毛利−经营利润）同比变化及其占收入比的变化，并判断'本季度盈利能力显著增强'这一说法是否成立、依据是什么。","scope":"联想集团合并口径公开财务数据（单位：百万美元）","as_of":null,"data_refs":["data/finsights.duckdb"],"case_revision":1,"reference_answer":"FY2026Q1 收入 18,829.869（同比 +3,382.813），毛利 2,774.477（同比 +214.628），毛利率 14.73% vs 上年 16.57%（−1.84pp）；经营利润 784.809（同比 +290.340，+58.72%）。背离发生在费用层：派生经营费用 1,989.668，同比仅 −75.712，费用率由 13.37% 降至 10.57%（−2.80pp）。即毛利率下滑 1.84pp 被费用率下降 2.80pp 抵消并超额，使经营利润反而大增。可以说'报表口径的经营利润与经营利润率显著改善'，但不能据此断定盈利能力已持续增强，因为单季费用率下降可能来自一次性收支，持续性需更多证据。","sources":[{"title":"二零二五/二六年財政年度第一季業績公佈","url":"https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2025/0814/2025081400028_c.pdf","publish_date":"2025-08-14","period":"FY2026Q1","page":13,"table_row":"收入/毛利/經營溢利","table_col":"本期欄與比較欄","note":"FY2026Q1 利潤表"}],"scoring_points":[{"point_id":"p1","atomic_judgment":"给出 FY2026Q1 收入约 18,830 百万美元、毛利约 2,774 百万美元","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["FY2026Q1 收入与毛利"],"acceptable_equivalents":["188.3 亿美元","2,774.5 百万美元"],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]},{"point_id":"p2","atomic_judgment":"给出毛利率同比降幅约 1.8pp（16.6%→14.7%）","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["FY2026Q1 毛利率"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":["称毛利率上升或持平"],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]},{"point_id":"p3","atomic_judgment":"给出经营利润同比约 +58.7%（+290 百万美元），经营利润率约 4.2%","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["FY2026Q1 经营利润"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]},{"point_id":"p4","atomic_judgment":"指出背离发生在费用层：派生经营费用同比约 −76 百万美元、费用率下降约 2.8pp","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["派生经营费用"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":["p2","p3"]},{"point_id":"p5","atomic_judgment":"结论：可说经营利润/经营利润率显著改善，但不能断定持续性/无依据归因","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["持续性判断"],"acceptable_equivalents":["改善明显但持续性未知"],"contradiction_examples":["无条件声称盈利能力已持续增强"],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]},{"point_id":"p6","atomic_judgment":"毛利率下降与经营利润增长并不矛盾：毛利仍为正增长，费用率下降更多","condition":null,"required":"optional","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":[],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":["p2","p4"]}],"numeric_assertions":[{"metric":"revenue","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2026Q1","baseline_period":null,"value":18829.869,"unit":"usd_mn","direction":"up","formula":null,"tolerance":0.005,"tolerance_abs":null,"category":"core"},{"metric":"gross_profit","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2026Q1","baseline_period":null,"value":2774.477,"unit":"usd_mn","direction":"up","formula":null,"tolerance":0.005,"tolerance_abs":null,"category":"core"},{"metric":"gross_margin_delta","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2026Q1","baseline_period":"FY2025Q1","value":-1.837,"unit":"pct_point","direction":"down","formula":null,"tolerance":0.005,"tolerance_abs":null,"category":"core"},{"metric":"operating_income","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2026Q1","baseline_period":null,"value":784.809,"unit":"usd_mn","direction":"up","formula":null,"tolerance":0.005,"tolerance_abs":null,"category":"core"},{"metric":"operating_income_growth_pct","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2026Q1","baseline_period":"FY2025Q1","value":58.72,"unit":"pct","direction":"up","formula":null,"tolerance":0.005,"tolerance_abs":null,"category":"core"},{"metric":"operating_expense","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2026Q1","baseline_period":null,"value":1989.668,"unit":"usd_mn","direction":"down","formula":"毛利−经营利润","tolerance":0.005,"tolerance_abs":null,"category":"supporting"},{"metric":"opex_ratio_delta","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2026Q1","baseline_period":"FY2025Q1","value":-2.804,"unit":"pct_point","direction":"down","formula":null,"tolerance":0.08,"tolerance_abs":null,"category":"supporting"}],"forbidden_claims":["毛利率下降等于盈利能力恶化","无条件断言经营改善具备持续性","把费用率下降归因为具体的单一经营原因而无证据"],"review_status":"draft","data_visibility":{"basis":"current_retrospective"},"reasoning_requirements":["单季同比","利润层分解","费用率","证据边界"],"question_type":"attribution","real_synthetic":"real","split":"dev","origin":"new","event_family":"LV-FY2026Q1-margin-vs-expense-divergence","split_group":"FY2026","selected_id":null,"diagnostic":false,"blocked":false,"blocked_reason":null,"forecast_truth":null,"generator":null,"notes":"源自已审 S07 事件，按新协议重写；公式与中间值移至评测侧。"}
{"case_id":"LV-E2E-FY2027Q1-INVENTORY-DIO-001","question":"联想集团 FY2027Q1 期末存货同比大增约 80%。这是否意味着周转'恶化了 80%'？请按口径 DIO = 平均存货 ÷ 单季营业成本 × 当季天数（平均存货 =（期初存货 + 期末存货)/2，当季天数取 91）计算 FY2027Q1 与上年同期 FY2026Q1 的 DIO 及变化天数，并说明高增长与 DIO 变化各自支持什么结论、不支持什么结论。","scope":"联想集团合并口径公开财务数据（单位：百万美元）","as_of":null,"data_refs":["data/finsights.duckdb"],"case_revision":1,"reference_answer":"FY2027Q1 期末存货 15,741.947，同比 +6,999.312（+80.06%）。按 91 天口径：FY2027Q1 平均存货 (11,720.885+15,741.947)/2=13,731.416，DIO=13,731.416/22,490.797×91≈55.56 天；FY2026Q1 平均存货 (7,923.804+8,742.635)/2=8,333.220，DIO=8,333.220/16,055.392×91≈47.23 天；DIO 同比上升约 8.33 天。因此：存货金额 +80% 是规模变化，DIO +8.33 天是周转天数变化，二者不是同一口径，'周转恶化 80%'不成立；数据支持的是周转天数温和上升（约 +18% 相对），但要把该上升解释为需求/备货等具体经营原因则超出这些数字，需更多披露。","sources":[{"title":"二零二六/ 二七年財政年度第一季業績公佈","url":"https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2026/0813/2026081300142_c.pdf","publish_date":"2026-08-13","period":"FY2027Q1","page":12,"table_row":"營業成本","table_col":null,"note":"FY27Q1 利潤表"},{"title":"二零二六/ 二七年財政年度第一季業績公佈","url":"https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2026/0813/2026081300142_c.pdf","publish_date":"2026-08-13","period":"FY2027Q1","page":14,"table_row":"存貨","table_col":null,"note":"FY27Q1 資產負債表"},{"title":"二零二五/二六年財政年度第一季業績公佈","url":"https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2025/0814/2025081400028_c.pdf","publish_date":"2025-08-14","period":"FY2026Q1","page":15,"table_row":"存貨","table_col":null,"note":"FY26Q1 資產負債表（期初/上年）"},{"title":"二零二四/ 二五年財政年度全年業績公佈","url":"https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2025/0522/2025052200194_c.pdf","publish_date":"2025-05-22","period":"FY2025Q4","page":19,"table_row":"存貨","table_col":null,"note":"FY25Q4 資產負債表（期初）"}],"scoring_points":[{"point_id":"p1","atomic_judgment":"给出 FY2027Q1 期末存货约 15,742 百万美元、同比约 +80%","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["FY2027Q1 存货"],"acceptable_equivalents":["157.4 亿美元"],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]},{"point_id":"p2","atomic_judgment":"按平均存货口径给出 FY2027Q1 DIO 约 55.6 天","condition":"使用 91 天、平均存货","required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["DIO 本期"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]},{"point_id":"p3","atomic_judgment":"给出上年同期 FY2026Q1 DIO 约 47.2 天","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["DIO 上年同"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":["p2"]},{"point_id":"p4","atomic_judgment":"DIO 同比上升约 8.3 天（约 +18%，而非 +80%）","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["DIO 变化"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":["称 DIO 同比上升约 80%"],"verification":null,"prerequisites":["p2","p3"]},{"point_id":"p5","atomic_judgment":"区分规模（存货 +80%）与周转天数（DIO +8.3 天）两种口径，否定'周转恶化 80%'","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["口径区分"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":["p4"]},{"point_id":"p6","atomic_judgment":"只陈述数字支持的结论，不无依据归因为具体经营原因","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["证据边界"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":["断定需求转弱/备货过度的具体成因"],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]}],"numeric_assertions":[{"metric":"inventory","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2027Q1","baseline_period":null,"value":15741.947,"unit":"usd_mn","direction":"up","formula":null,"tolerance":0.005,"tolerance_abs":null,"category":"core"},{"metric":"inventory_growth_pct","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2027Q1","baseline_period":"FY2026Q1","value":80.06,"unit":"pct","direction":"up","formula":null,"tolerance":0.005,"tolerance_abs":null,"category":"core"},{"metric":"dio_days","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2027Q1","baseline_period":null,"value":55.56,"unit":"days","direction":"up","formula":null,"tolerance":0.002,"tolerance_abs":0.1,"category":"core"},{"metric":"dio_days_prior","company":"Lenovo","period":"FY2026Q1","baseline