{"case_id":"LV-E2E-FY2026Q2-REVENUE-FORECAST-001","question":"以 2025-08-14 为信息截止日（联想 FY2026Q1 业绩公告已发布），请预测联想集团 FY2026Q2（截至 2025-09-30）的营业收入。给出预测值、预测区间与方法，并说明你使用了哪些当时可见的信息与假设、主要不确定性来自哪里。","scope":"联想集团合并口径公开财务数据（单位：百万美元）","as_of":"2025-08-14","data_refs":["data/finsights.duckdb"],"case_revision":1,"reference_answer":"截至 2025-08-14 可见：FY2026Q1 收入 18,829.869（同比 +21.9%），FY2025Q2 收入 17,850.094，FY2025 四大单季与 FY2026Q1 已披露。合理做法：以上年同期为基准叠加近四季同比增速/季节形态给出区间，例如以 +12%~+18% 同比得到约 20,000~21,050 百万美元，中枢约 20,500。允许的推理：季节性叠加近期同比；不确定性来自 PC 需求、汇率与 AI 服务器交付节奏；管理层展望可作参考，但非唯一答案。不要求命中某一具体数值。","sources":[{"title":"二零二五/二六年財政年度第一季業績公佈","url":"https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2025/0814/2025081400028_c.pdf","publish_date":"2025-08-14","period":"FY2026Q1","page":13,"table_row":null,"table_col":null,"note":"FY26Q1 收入（as_of 可见）"},{"title":"二零二四/二五年財政年度中期業績公佈","url":"https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2024/1115/2024111500032_c.pdf","publish_date":"2024-11-15","period":"FY2025Q2","page":12,"table_row":null,"table_col":null,"note":"FY25Q2 收入（as_of 可见）"}],"scoring_points":[{"point_id":"p1","atomic_judgment":"明确以 2025-08-14 及之前可见的数据为输入（如 FY2026Q1 收入、FY2025 同期）","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["可见信息"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":["引用 FY2026Q2 及以后的数据"],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]},{"point_id":"p2","atomic_judgment":"给出一个明确的点预测值或中枢（数量级在 1.9 万~2.2 万百万美元区间内合理）","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["点预测"],"acceptable_equivalents":["约 20,000~21,000 百万美元"],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]},{"point_id":"p3","atomic_judgment":"给出预测区间且区间有限（未使用无限宽区间）","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evidence_source":["区间"],"acceptable_equivalents":[],"contradiction_examples":[],"verification":null,"prerequisites":[]},{"point_id":"p4","atomic_judgment":"说明预测方法（如同比增速外推/季节形态），不要求唯一方法","condition":null,"required":"required","weight":1.0,"evid